plicants, closed-cycle dates, required portals, tests and preparation for the next official call.\",\"image\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/images/design/china/china-4-1280.webp\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-19\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-19\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/editorial-policy/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/logo.svg\"}},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/hec-chinese-government-scholarship/\"}"}}],["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is the HEC 2027/28 Chinese scholarship open?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"A new 2027/28 HEC call was not verified in this review. The reviewed 2026/27 round is closed.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Can I use a university’s deadline for HEC?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. HEC nomination and university applications have separate controlling deadlines.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Should I prepare before the next call?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes. Organise academic documents and shortlist courses, while waiting for current instructions before relying on test dates or eligibility thresholds.\"}}]}"}}]],["$","section",null,{"className":"inner-hero inner-hero--compact inner-hero--guide inner-hero--visual","children":"$L18"}],false,"$L19","$L1a"]}]
