1e:["$","section","1-What HEC nomination does and does not cover",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-2","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"What HEC nomination does and does not cover"}],[["$","p","HEC’s role is the Pakistan nomination route described in its official Chinese Government Scholarship notice. Applicants must satisfy the national process as well as the intended Chinese programme’s admission conditions. HEC nomination is not an automatic university offer or final scholarship award.",{"children":"HEC’s role is the Pakistan nomination route described in its official Chinese Government Scholarship notice. Applicants must satisfy the national process as well as the intended Chinese programme’s admission conditions. HEC nomination is not an automatic university offer or final scholarship award."}],["$","p","A direct university Type B application is a separate process. Do not assume that a university application also submits an HEC nomination request. Equally, a closed HEC round does not establish that every university scholarship in China is unavailable.",{"children":"A direct university Type B application is a separate process. Do not assume that a university application also submits an HEC nomination request. Equally, a closed HEC round does not establish that every university scholarship in China is unavailable."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
1f:["$","section","2-Check the next call before booking tests",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-3","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Check the next call before booking tests"}],[["$","p","HEC’s reviewed eligibility instructions include national test requirements and undergraduate CSCA guidance. The accepted test category, minimum score, validity period and relevant examination dates must come from the call for your intake. Last year’s test date is not a reliable booking instruction for a new round.",{"children":"HEC’s reviewed eligibility instructions include national test requirements and undergraduate CSCA guidance. The accepted test category, minimum score, validity period and relevant examination dates must come from the call for your intake. Last year’s test date is not a reliable booking instruction for a new round."}],["$","p","Use the preparation period to identify which tests you would need, where you can take them and how long results take. Keep the official score report and verify whether the scholarship portal receives it automatically or requires an upload. Undergraduate candidates should also check CSCA subjects against their target university’s programme list.",{"children":"Use the preparation period to identify which tests you would need, where you can take them and how long results take. Keep the official score report and verify whether the scholarship portal receives it automatically or requires an upload. Undergraduate candidates should also check CSCA subjects against their target university’s programme list."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
20:["$","section","3-Keep the two application systems consistent",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Keep the two application systems consistent"}],[["$","p","Follow HEC’s application instructions for its portal and the corresponding CSC entry. Record the programme category and receiving organisation exactly as the current notice specifies. Compare passport name, academic qualifications and intended study level before final submission.",{"children":"Follow HEC’s application instructions for its portal and the corresponding CSC entry. Record the programme category and receiving organisation exactly as the current notice specifies. Compare passport name, academic qualifications and intended study level before final submission."}],["$","p","Download the completed forms and keep application numbers from both systems. A payment receipt, draft record or account registration is not evidence that an application has been submitted. Check the final status and retain the confirmation page.",{"children":"Download the completed forms and keep application numbers from both systems. A payment receipt, draft record or account registration is not evidence that an application has been submitted. Check the final status and retain the confirmation page."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
21:["$","section","4-Resolve pre-admission ambiguity early",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Resolve pre-admission ambiguity early"}],[["$","p","HEC’s reviewed documents and eligibility pages do not use fully consistent wording about pre-admission. Do not rely on an interpretation that it is optional in all cases. Prepare to obtain an appropriate document and ask HEC which wording controls the current intake.",{"children":"HEC’s reviewed documents and eligibility pages do not use fully consistent wording about pre-admission. Do not rely on an interpretation that it is optional in all cases. Prepare to obtain an appropriate document and ask HEC which wording controls the current intake."}],["$","p","When contacting HEC, quote the two relevant instructions and identify the degree and route you intend to use. For university contact, explain the intended programme and your research fit. A general email of interest should not be labelled a formally accepted pre-admission letter unless it meets the required format.",{"children":"When contacting HEC, quote the two relevant instructions and identify the degree and route you intend to use. For university contact, explain the intended programme and your research fit. A general email of interest should not be labelled a formally accepted pre-admission letter unless it meets the required format."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined"]}]
22:["$","section","5-Prepare a Pakistan-specific evidence folder",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Prepare a Pakistan-specific evidence folder"}],[["$","p","Organise identity, academic and application records into clear folders. Compare the name on your passport with degree and transcript records before requesting translations or verification. If there is a discrepancy, ask the issuing organisation how to correct or document it.",{"children":"Organise identity, academic and application records into clear folders. Compare the name on your passport with degree and transcript records before requesting translations or verification. If there is a discrepancy, ask the issuing organisation how to correct or document it."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","$L27",null,{"id":"guides/hec-chinese-government-scholarship:section-6","title":"Check your progress","items":["Valid identity and passport details checked","Degree and transcript scans complete","Required national test evidence identified","University language and programme criteria checked","Pre-admission requirement clarified","Health and police documents timed to their validity windows","Both portal confirmations retained"]}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
23:["$","section","6-Build a realistic plan while the next round is unconfirmed",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-7","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Build a realistic plan while the next round is unconfirmed"}],[["$","p","Use this interval to shortlist eligible courses, improve your study plan and request references. Do not spend on an agent’s guaranteed nomination package. Keep an expense budget for documents, tests and travel; a funding award may not reimburse every preparation cost.",{"children":"Use this interval to shortlist eligible courses, improve your study plan and request references. Do not spend on an agent’s guaranteed nomination package. Keep an expense budget for documents, tests and travel; a funding award may not reimburse every preparation cost."}],["$","p","When a new HEC call appears, compare it line by line with your preparation checklist. Refresh dates, score rules, required documents and award conditions before applying. This page deliberately leaves the next-cycle deadline unannounced because no verified new notice was found.",{"children":"When a new HEC call appears, compare it line by line with your preparation checklist. Refresh dates, score rules, required documents and award conditions before applying. This page deliberately leaves the next-cycle deadline unannounced because no verified new notice was found."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Build a realistic plan while the next round is unconfirmed","children":[["$","$L4","/guides/csc-scholarship-type-a-vs-type-b/",{"href":"/guides/csc-scholarship-type-a-vs-type-b/","children":["Compare university Type B routes",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}],["$","$L4","/countries/china/",{"href":"/countries/china/","children":["China scholarship hub",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
